# Strong coupling is not simply faster. The kick spreads over the neighbours before it can fire its own site, so a stronger kick is needed, and each site then fires more than once.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Chain of 8, strong coupling 0.2, kick 4
sites 8
path 1 8 kappa=0.2
kick 1 amplitude=4
run 1500
